# Project execution

Follow the root AGENTS.md and docs/agent-workflow.md.
Read PLAN_IMPLEMENTACION_EDITOR_LATEX_COLABORATIVO.md completely before project work in a new session; retain English contracts and documented scope adaptations.
For each new sprint, create and publish codex/sprint-XX-<topic> with origin upstream before implementation (for example codex/sprint-01-data-contracts).
Derive XX and topic from the selected implementation/sprint-XX-topic directory; use lowercase hyphenated topics.
Reuse feature/sprint-00 for the existing S00. Verify prerequisite evidence and branch base, preserve contributor changes, and never force-push or merge automatically.
Record actual branch/base and passing evidence; unavailable GitHub access is an explicit blocker.
